hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1744","[AI-translation] Imepokewa kutoka kwa 'Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr (Radhiya Allaahu 'anhumaa) alisema: Mwenyezi Mungu Alimwamuru Nabii Wake (Swalla Allaahu 'alayhi wa sallam) achukue msamaha katika tabia za watu. (Bukhari: 4644) [Kauli Yake Mwenyezi Mungu Mtukufu: ""Na wapigeni mpaka fitna isibaki""]"
